# Sample requests (VS Code REST Client / Visual Studio / Rider).
# Set @gateway to the gateway URL shown in the Aspire dashboard.
@gateway = http://localhost:5100

### Catalogue with live stock
GET {{gateway}}/api/products

### Place an order (happy path)
# @name placeOrder
POST {{gateway}}/api/orders
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: demo-order-001

{
  "customerEmail": "buyer@example.com",
  "items": [
    { "sku": "KB-MECH-01", "quantity": 1 },
    { "sku": "MS-WL-02", "quantity": 2 }
  ]
}

### Follow the order (Submitted -> AwaitingStock -> AwaitingPayment -> Completed)
GET {{gateway}}/api/orders/{{placeOrder.response.body.$.orderId}}

### Payment declined -> Failed, stock released (compensation)
POST {{gateway}}/api/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "customerEmail": "decline@example.com",
  "items": [ { "sku": "CAM-HD-1080", "quantity": 1 } ]
}

### Out of stock -> Failed, nothing charged
POST {{gateway}}/api/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "customerEmail": "buyer@example.com",
  "items": [ { "sku": "SSD-NVME-1T", "quantity": 10 } ]
}

### Restock a product
POST {{gateway}}/api/products/SSD-NVME-1T/restock
Content-Type: application/json

{ "quantity": 20 }

### Orders for a customer
GET {{gateway}}/api/orders?email=buyer@example.com
